648
00:36:48,540 --> 00:36:52,790
Now, let me unpack RLHF
or reinforcement learning

649
00:36:52,790 --> 00:36:54,120
with human feedback.

650
00:36:54,120 --> 00:36:59,346
How do we integrate and use
