00:39:53,880 --> 00:39:57,920
And we directly go from the
preference reference data

699
00:39:57,920 --> 00:39:58,950
into policy.

700
00:39:58,950 --> 00:40:01,800
And then given that
reference model,

701
00:40:01,800 --> 00:40:04,040
we want to see how
close this preference

702
00:40:04,040 --> 00:40:07,190
data is to the policy.

703
00:40:07,190 --> 00:40:10,950
So many new variants of
GDPR also introduced.

704
00:40:10,950 --> 00:40:12,540
So here I'm summarizing them.

705
00:40:12,540 --> 00:40:15,530
This is the PPO, the
original formulation.

706
00:40:15,530 --> 00:40:19,160
Here is the direct preference
optimization, which

