708
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:24,800
Given the preference data, I
would always say think of it

709
00:40:24,800 --> 00:40:29,930
as some ranking objective,
and then the newer variants

710
00:40:29,930 --> 00:40:34,340
like, which even makes it more
